s just in for  the diamond that he just stole two years  passed by and miles is released from  prison as expected he is very excited to  get his freedom back and starts shouting  in the streets then he takes a cab  straight to his girlfriend janiece's  house hoping that they can spend some  romantic time together but to his dismay  Janiece breaks up with him for lying  about being a criminal why'd she think  he was in jail distraught miles promises  to change and pleads with her to take  him back but she refuses to listen and  shuts him out now with nothing else to  do he goes to retrieve the diamond sadly  miles is once again left in disbelief  when he finds out that the under  construction building where he had  hidden the diamond is now an LAPD police  station despite this he is still adamant  on retrieving the valuable gemstone to  put his plan into motion miles enters  the building and learns that the diamond  is hidden in the ducts of what is now  the robbery slash homicide detective  Bureau which requires a key card to  access later he researches the security  measures and returns as a pizza delivery  man in Disguise he asks to be led into  the homicide department but as expected  the cops deny it buddy this ain't that  kind of movie left with no choice miles  pretends to start a conversation with  homicide detective Carlson and sneakily  steals his access card later miles takes  the card to his Shady Uncle Lou and  requests him to forge a new new one for  him at first Uncle Lou is hesitant  claiming that the job is a risky one but  when miles offers him a lot of cash he  agrees the cash is so significant that  Lou not only forges a fake card but also  a badge and some documents which  established that miles is a newly  transferred police detective named  Malone using this cover he goes to the  police station to retrieve the diamond  after accessing the homicide department  using his fake card miles heads straight  to the female washroom to access the  ducts 