zen heavy rims onto a truck  and flee miles assumes that the owner is  lying and when he checks a nearby parked  truck near the warehouse he finds all  the stolen items there caught red-handed  the owner admits to committing the fraud  for insurance money and Miles lets him  go with only a Stern warning naturally  Carlson questions miles reason behind  letting the owner go and the latter  explains that sometimes you have to let  the small fish go to catch the bigger  fish on their way back to the station  miles takes charge of the steering wheel  and teaches Carlson how to ride like a  True Detective which is over speeding  and almost crashing into other cars just  like a runaway criminal would do after a  while miles stops at a store for some  gum but he again finds himself in an  unfortunate situation an armed robber  storms into the store and demands the  owner open the cash register left with  no choice miles is forced to intervene  but to his surprise the robber is  revealed to be none other than his ex  accomplice Tully they are stunned to see  each other and just as they recover from  the shock Carlson also storms into the  store to keep his cover miles lets Tully  Escape through the back door but  unfortunately Carlson calls for backup  and they eventually Corner him in the  street Tully refuses to surrender and  detective Hard Castle suggests calling  for a SWAT team however to keep his  secret from getting out and to stop his  friend from being killed miles disarms  himself and walks up to Tully to  convince him to surrender when the  latter refuses Smiles offers to give him  twenty thousand dollars and release him  after a day in prison Tully obviously  agrees to that and Miles pretends to  arrest him in a stylish manner later  Carlson tells everyone at the department  about how miles heroically subdued a  dangerous criminal with his bare hands  his days pass by miles's knowledge on  criminal activity and the ability to  foil crimes makes him quite popular  among his peers one day Lieutenant Rizzo  again calls him to his office and  reveals that the burglary division has  been wanting a new head and that he  thinks that miles would be the right  person for the job not wanting to blow  his cover miles reluctantly accepts the  position the same day he makes another  attempt to locate the diamond but when  he reaches the exact spot he finds it  missing later he learns from detective  Hardcastle that one of the hot water  pipes burst some time ago and flooded  all the vents because of which the  department had to flush out the whole  system on the other hand the treacherous  Deacon learns of miles's release and  shows up at Uncle Lou's place the old  man denies having any knowledge of  miles's whereabouts but a furious Deacon  shoves him against a table and goes  through his documents there he  eventually finds out about miles's new  identity back at the police station when  Tully has to spend more than a day in  jail he threatens to out miles but ends  up getting beaten up badly in the next  scene miles continues his Pursuit for  the diamond with the help of a remote  control car he eventually locates it in  the air duct right above Rizzo's Office  later Carlson catches miles snooping  through the docks and inquires about  what's going on he also reveals that he  looked up his name and badge number in  the police records but couldn't find  anyone named Malone worried about being  exposed miles lies to Carlson that he is  from internal affairs and that he is  here on an undercover Mission  surprisingly Carlson buys his lies and  Promises to keep it a secret with little  to no chance of recovering the diamond  through Rizzo's office miles looks for a  way through an adjacent room which is  the highly secured evidence room however  before you could try to find a way in  miles is sent out on another call  apparently a museum exhibit has been  stolen from a cargo hold but at the  scene they learned that the thieves have  left the museum exhibits intact the FBI  is also at the scene and Miles butts  heads with FBI agent gray over who has  the jurisdiction over the crime after a  while the LAPD is ordered to vacate the  crime scene and Miles has to oblige but  not before giving the Arrogant FBI  agents an ear fall on their way back  with his extensive knowledge and  experience miles deduces that the FBI  was not looking for artifacts but drugs  he reveals that criminals often smuggle  drugs into the country from abroad as  cargo and steal it before it passes  through customs miles and his Squad then  look for bonded trucks these are the  only trucks that can go into bonded  warehouses they call in air support and  quickly spot a solitary truck riding  through the busy streets Having learned  from Miles Carlson zooms through the  city and zeros in on the truck the FBI  radios them to back off but miles into  Squad apprehend the Smugglers and  capture the truckload of heroin at a  traffic stop later that day miles enters  the evidence room pretending to inspect  the seized drugs there he finally  manages to retrieve the diamonds and  becomes ecstatic suddenly Rizzo shows up  and startles Miles causing him to  accidentally drop the diamond into the  load of heroin Rizzo then reveals that  the FBI is taking the heroine for  testing it turns out that the heroine  belongs to a notorious drug lord named  Gene LaFleur who operates from Mexico  not willing to let up on the diamond a  panicked mile suggests the FBI and his  police unit use the heroine as bait in a  sting operation to catch leflure he also  suggests that he himself will deliver  the goods to the drug lord the FBI loves  his suggestion and the operation is  immediately approved before leaving  miles covertly sets his friend Tully  free from holding after reaching the  destination miles quickly retrieves the  diamond but before he can escape Tully  shows up followed by Deacon the latter  seizes the diamond from miles at  gunpoint but soon LaFleur also shows up  left with no choice the police and FBI  raid the deal chaos ensues and taking  advantage of the opportunity Deacon  escapes with the diamond in an armored  truck miles runs after the truck and  manages to hop on its back soon the  police and the FBI also start to follow  as Deacon approaches the Mexican border  detective wood Castle tries to get  Deacon to stop the vehicle but ends up  crashing nearby with nothing else  working miles tries to swing his way to  the front of the truck but Deacon  crosses over into the Mexican border on  his way he drives through the barricade  put in place by both the Mexican and  American officials due to the prolonged  jerk miles falls off the truck and  watches as Deacon's van disappears from  his view the police in the FBI are  forced to Halt their Pursuit at the  border as they have no jurisdiction over  Mexico however miles refusing to give up  steals a patrol car and chases Deacon he  eventually catches up to Deacon and  causes his truck to crash a few seconds  later they both emerge from their  vehicles and hold each other at gunpoint  seeing the Mexican police making their  way to them miles offers him a deal  Deacon has to hand over the diamond and  in exchange miles will take him back to  the U.S and give him a cut after selling  the diamond however when Deacon obliges  miles immediately double-crosses him by  handcuffing him to the wrecked truck for  the federales and begins to walk back to  the U.S border Deacon draws a gun to  fire at him but miles turns and shoots  him dead avenging the death of Eddie  following this he crosses over to the  U.S where both the FBI and the police  demand explanations This Time Miles  tells them he's an undercover Mexican  officer and has to report back to his  fellow federales a few inches over the  Border Carlson and Hardcastle stop him  revealing that they know who he really  is however do not arrest him as they are  grateful for all of his help and see him  as a friend they also assure him that  the FBI can't reach him as he is a few  inches over the Border after they share  a Bittersweet goodbye miles heads off to  Mexico with the diamond subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

